{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/contract/clax-1/db.d.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-22T17:39:50.649590Z","id":"e8f2750e2f8643cb8d1bd87ca7a6be81ebc92c77da187b5e208b48bf29578ed7","body":{"detail":"web/contract/clax-1/ is 0.2.61 with db.d.ts (the public level, no organization-internal), assets.d.ts (/_clax/blob/<id>) and comments.d.ts edited; it is served at /_clax/contract/clax-1/<name>.d.ts (crates/clax-server/src/shell/mod.rs CLAX_CONTRACT_FILES) and docs/contract.md and the four skills point at it. CONTRACT_VERSION (crates/clax-core/src/model.rs:169) still stamps 0.2.61 into data-contract, since the bridge does not yet run the runtime from the site's own origin. The name, and when the stamp moves to it, are the owner's to choose.","kind":"comment","span":{"start":{"line":1},"end":{"line":31},"content_hash":"1a2f9c952b243f20426835fb1faccde60bab18ac82d076a0984961bfeac8d3af"},"summary":"Clax's own contract version is named clax-1, beside claude.ai's 0.2.61, and pages are still stamped 0.2.61","tags":["status:needs-decision","session:claude-code:cc23b85c-a691-4093-ab7a-f909d7a53e66"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/contract/clax-1/db.d.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-22T18:09:13.419328Z","id":"f675341271d4645d0476143ea27c27ec224942aaa9beb4c0dea4f8b5dcf7dd95","body":{"kind":"comment","references":"e8f2750e2f8643cb8d1bd87ca7a6be81ebc92c77da187b5e208b48bf29578ed7","summary":"The version is 0.3.0, the existing numbering: web/contract/clax-1/ moved to web/contract/0.3.0/, served at /_clax/contract/0.3.0/<name>.d.ts, and CONTRACT_VERSION (crates/clax-core/src/model.rs:169) now stamps 0.3.0 into data-contract. The bridge reads data-contract into its page metadata alone (web/bridge/src/meta.ts) and branches on nothing. Closing this is the owner's.","tags":["session:claude-code:cc23b85c-a691-4093-ab7a-f909d7a53e66"]}}
